Calendar limits on the built contracts, run in the embedded provider's runtime (pallet-contracts 51, 1 MiB of contract memory).
Each PROBE line is printed by a temporary provider test: it deploys Dao, registers one worker and calls
reserve_calendar and calendar. 'dense' and 'window' rounds raise the weekly capacity by one and reserve one minute
in every week of the window, so each round adds one reservation to each week.

